@startuml Integrated Asset + Tagging Flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam BoxPadding 20

title Complete System: Dynamic Assets + Tagging

box "Asset Addition" #LightBlue
  actor "Admin" as Admin1
  participant "GraphQL API" as API
  participant "Organization\nService" as Org
end box

box "Storage" #LightGreen
  database "Special Org\n(ASSET_SUPPORT_V2)" as SpecialOrg
  participant "HSM" as HSM
end box

box "Asset Registry Service" #LightYellow
  participant "Asset Cron\n(60s)" as AssetCron
  database "supported_asset" as AssetDB
  participant "Asset Registry\nService" as Service
  database "asset_tag" as TagDB
end box

box "Tag Management" #Lavender
  actor "Ops" as Admin2
  participant "Retool UI" as Retool
end box

box "Client Layer" #LightPink
  participant "AssetTypes\nClient (10s)" as Client
  database "Asset Cache" as AssetCache
  database "Tags Cache" as TagCache
  participant "Services" as Services
end box

== Step 1: Add New Asset (Existing Flow) ==

Admin1 -> API: Add Asset Support
API -> Org: Create org change
Org -> HSM: Sign organization
HSM --> SpecialOrg: Store signed org ✓

== Step 2: Asset Registry Sync (Existing) ==

AssetCron -> SpecialOrg: Get special org (every 60s)
SpecialOrg --> AssetCron: Return AssetConfigs
AssetCron -> AssetDB: Upsert assets

== Step 3: Apply Tags (NEW) ==

Admin2 -> Retool: Tag asset as "REBASING"
Retool -> Service: AddTagsToAsset gRPC
Service -> TagDB: Store tag association
TagDB --> Service: ✓
Service --> Retool: Success

== Step 4: Client Refresh (Enhanced) ==

Client -> Service: ListAssetTypes +\nListTagsWithAssetTypeIDs\n(every 10s)
activate Client

Service -> AssetDB: Query assets
activate Service
AssetDB --> Service: Assets list
Service -> TagDB: Query tags
TagDB --> Service: Tags map
Service --> Client: Assets + Tags
deactivate Service

Client -> AssetCache: Store assets
Client -> TagCache: Store tag mappings
note right
  AssetCache[assetID] = AssetInfo
  TagCache[tag] = []assetIDs

  Example:
  TagCache["REBASING"] =
    ["ethereum:steth", "ethereum:reth"]
end note
deactivate Client

== Step 5: Service Usage (Enhanced) ==

Services -> Client: GetByTags("REBASING")
activate Services
Client -> TagCache: Lookup
TagCache --> Client: Asset IDs
Client -> AssetCache: Get asset details
AssetCache --> Client: Asset info
Client --> Services: Rebasing assets with full details

Services -> Services: Apply rebasing logic\nto all returned assets
deactivate Services

@enduml
